AD  - State Key Laboratory of Geomechanics and Geotechnical Engineering, Institute of Rock and Soil Mechanics, Chinese Academy of Sciences, Wuhan, 430071, China
AD  - Department of Mining Engineering, Universidad de Chile, Avenida Beauchef, Santiago, 850, Chile
AD  - Advanced Mining Technology Center, Universidad de Chile, Avenida Beauchef, Santiago, 850, Chile
AD  - Escuela de Ingeniería de Construcción y Transporte, Pontificia Universidad Catolica de Valparaíso, Chile
